{"title":"Yeti Ravager","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 60 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 5× XP and 5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>622</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>131</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>138</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>60</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>622</td><td>in the wilds around 440, -994</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>131</td><td>in the wilds around 34, -1097</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>138</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"yeti-ravager\" data-map-level=\"60\">Show level 60 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 20 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 32 recorded drops, 3,238 total, 16–599 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×16–599</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-fang\" title=\"Yeti Fang - in 15 of 20 looted corpses, 15 recorded drops, 19 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b964f6987e786c9b807e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"yeti-hide\" title=\"Yeti Hide - in 6 of 20 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 5 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/978483ebfccb2cae6e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silverhide-head\" title=\"Silverhide Head - in 3 of 20 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d5250e2dda1660455a50.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silverhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 2 of 3 · Shoddy: 1 of 3</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bones\" title=\"Bones - in 2 of 20 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c29e1ebe544dbfedca68.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bones</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1–2</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-feet\" title=\"Dragonscale Feet - in 1 of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7ce6de157efd9abd04f5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/20<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"yeti-hide\" title=\"Yeti Hide - in 6 of 20 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/978483ebfccb2cae6e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Yeti Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Frostfang&#39;s Eyrie</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 138</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6502\">Layout</button></li><li><b>Whitecrown Caves</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 15</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-424\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3932.1px,769.8px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/16/-4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:-1024px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/16/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:-768px\"><i style=\"left:3949.0px;top:-719.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3837.8px;top:-851.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3850.7px;top:-774.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:3975.3px;top:-747.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:3935.5px;top:-792.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:4018.8px;top:-740.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:3836.3px;top:-814.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:3907.8px;top:-808.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:3858.9px;top:-789.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3850.7px;top:-829.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:4103.5px;top:-732.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:4020.9px;top:-775.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:3810.5px;top:-793.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:4017.5px;top:-728.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:3965.5px;top:-760.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:3815.8px;top:-765.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:3877.7px;top:-785.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:3816.6px;top:-782.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:3952.0px;top:-754.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:3861.2px;top:-752.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:4075.0px;top:-761.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:4012.1px;top:-723.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:3924.3px;top